  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-10-29T02:41:51.817Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "(copied from a petition I plan to close down soon, since I found this website.) \n\nI believe it should be possible to change the username in VRChat. Why? You might ask? Because some people (like me) have an embarrassing username or a username that we don't like, maybe because a ex left someone, a divorce, death of a loved one, etc.\nWe also have to log in using that username so we see it every time we do. You might say \"just log in using your email address\", while that is true, we can log in using our email address but the username shows up under your display name on the VRChat website.\nThat's where my problem comes in (and possibly other ones as well), I don't want anyone to see a username I set when I was naive, and that's why I want to change it for good.\nI hope the VRChat Team sees this and considers to let us change our username in the future.",
